{
  "name": "HL · Tomorrow's order messages → Outbox",
  "nodes": [
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## HL · Tomorrow's order messages → Outbox (Lesson 3.2)\nFor every order delivering tomorrow: look up the customer, build a WhatsApp-ready message and a one-tap wa.me link, and append them to the Outbox sheet. Nothing is sent.\n\n**Credential:** Google Sheets (OAuth2), selected in all three Sheets nodes.\n**Placeholder:** YOUR_SHEET_ID (one workbook with tabs Orders, Customers, Outbox).\n\nOrders and Find customer come with **pinned test data** (3 orders, 3 customers), so manual runs never call Google. Unpin both (pin icon in Output) to use your real sheet. Published runs always use real data.\n\nOnce it works, swap the Manual Trigger for a Schedule Trigger at 18:00.",
        "height": 420,
        "width": 420
      },
      "id": "208c678f-3863-436d-93da-0057f6b0bb08",
      "name": "About this workflow",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        -484,
        -180
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {},
      "id": "20bf3619-77ab-461d-a2a9-15b6985b075b",
      "name": "Manual Trigger",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.manualTrigger",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        0,
        0
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "documentId": {
          "__rl": true,
          "value": "YOUR_SHEET_ID",
          "mode": "id"
        },
        "sheetName": {
          "__rl": true,
          "value": "Orders",
          "mode": "name"
        },
        "options": {},
        "filtersUI": {
          "values": [
            {
              "lookupColumn": "delivery_date",
              "lookupValue": "={{ $today.plus({ days: 1 }).toISODate() }}"
            }
          ]
        }
      },
      "id": "b1e3fcc9-adf2-40ce-afcb-99ad03b69b45",
      "name": "Orders",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.googleSheets",
      "typeVersion": 4.5,
      "position": [
        220,
        0
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "documentId": {
          "__rl": true,
          "value": "YOUR_SHEET_ID",
          "mode": "id"
        },
        "sheetName": {
          "__rl": true,
          "value": "Customers",
          "mode": "name"
        },
        "options": {},
        "filtersUI": {
          "values": [
            {
              "lookupColumn": "customer_id",
              "lookupValue": "={{ $json.customer_id }}"
            }
          ]
        }
      },
      "id": "1c79fae2-a957-4722-a280-7be13289702d",
      "name": "Find customer",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.googleSheets",
      "typeVersion": 4.5,
      "position": [
        440,
        0
      ],
      "alwaysOutputData": true
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "mode": "manual",
        "assignments": {
          "assignments": [
            {
              "id": "23a31705-e2db-41ce-8596-9b83d3b9c2a2",
              "name": "order_id",
              "value": "={{ $('Orders').item.json.order_id }}",
              "type": "string"
            },
            {
              "id": "d9050f70-94b7-42ce-a16e-48995b9bac7a",
              "name": "phone",
              "value": "={{ $json.phone }}",
              "type": "string"
            },
            {
              "id": "d83b0276-e093-4621-89ac-eae8447426a6",
              "name": "message",
              "value": "=Hello {{ $json.name ?? 'Customer' }} 👋\nYour Harvest Lane order {{ $('Orders').item.json.order_id }} is confirmed:\n{{ $('Orders').item.json.items }}\nTotal: ₦{{ $('Orders').item.json.total.toLocaleString('en-NG') }}\nDelivery: {{ DateTime.fromISO($('Orders').item.json.delivery_date).toFormat('cccc d LLL') }}, {{ $json.area }}.\nReply 1 to confirm or 2 to change.",
              "type": "string"
            }
          ]
        },
        "options": {}
      },
      "id": "4a174f36-0a63-4cd6-b744-dcbbf571525b",
      "name": "Build message",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.set",
      "typeVersion": 3.4,
      "position": [
        660,
        0
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "mode": "manual",
        "assignments": {
          "assignments": [
            {
              "id": "9abc7727-7e4b-4921-8b85-bf44b018f77b",
              "name": "wa_link",
              "value": "=https://wa.me/{{ ($json.phone ?? '').replace('+', '') }}?text={{ encodeURIComponent($json.message) }}",
              "type": "string"
            }
          ]
        },
        "options": {},
        "includeOtherFields": true
      },
      "id": "582682cd-83c4-473d-b019-ef9dd45e3286",
      "name": "Add WhatsApp link",
